        f"Numerator: {panel['identity']['numerator']}. Energy boundary: {panel['identity']['energy_boundary']}.",
        "",
        f"Anchors: `{json.dumps(panel['identity']['anchors'])}`; worlds: `{json.dumps(panel['identity']['worlds'])}`; "
        f"dates: `{json.dumps(panel['identity']['dates'])}`; world seeds: `{json.dumps(panel['identity']['world_seeds'])}`.",
        "",
        f"Fixed-point traversal order: **{panel['identity']['fixed_point_traversal_order']}**.",
        "",
        "Loss values are not read or reported as EE evidence.",
        "",
        "## Knockout check before the primary contrast",
